ncrypt: Support ECDSA P-256 keys and persisted (named) keys.
NCryptCreatePersistedKey accepts ECDSA_P256 (from upstream Wine, with provider
reference counting) and key names: NCryptFinalizeKey stores the private key blob in
the registry (HKCU, or HKLM with NCRYPT_MACHINE_KEY_FLAG, under
Software\Wine\NCrypt\Keys). NCryptOpenKey loads it (NTE_BAD_KEYSET if missing),
NCryptDeleteKey removes it, NCRYPT_OVERWRITE_KEY_FLAG/NTE_EXISTS are honoured and
NCryptImportKey accepts ECDSA P-256 blobs. Keys are not DPAPI-protected.
Epic Games Launcher / EOS needs this for its DPoP key
("Epic/EpicGamesLauncher/EOS/Auth"); before, it logged "Failed to create persistent
DPoP key (Status: 0x80090029)". ncrypt tests: 470 executed, 0 failures (34 new).

